      "title": "Private operations view",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Host, queue and selected container metrics only. No prompts, replies, account identifiers, credentials or application logs are collected. Updates every 20 seconds; gaps or an old metric age mean monitoring is unavailable. These metrics do not establish inference speed or user capacity. Monitoring runs on the Samsung and stays available while the Mac is off."
